Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.49,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,750)}A Gentle Snowfall of Remembrance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Usopp! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you run out to? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.32,0:00:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be up here for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in there? Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I just saw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're calling you. No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing hide-and-seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out here or I'll kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know where\Nit was up at Sniper King?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're his friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, no need to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took a different boat and\Nwent on ahead by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary's his ship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they haven't figured it out\Nyet, then what's it gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.96,0:01:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're the\Nonly ones on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mary didn't sail itself here, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.74,0:01:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone was calling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole crew heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you don't know who it was? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a voice beckoning us to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.14,0:01:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer here is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, that was\NMary's voice we heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd know by now\Nif the ship could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.66,0:01:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, as ridiculous as it may\Nsound, I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, there's a ship coming! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see the Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew they'd make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Galley-La company ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were done for when\Nthey went out during Aqualaguna!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget Aqua Laguna!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They survived Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha! Ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Iceberg?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice surprise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They pulled it off after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took on the world government and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha! Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They lost it all, and then\Nthey brought it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their ship! It's breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why is it falling\Napart all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing sudden about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all knew this was inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we left, they said\NMary was unfit to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Puffs, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got here just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all shipwrights, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her die now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary's more than just a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a member of our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for her, we all\Nwould have died back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come on, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fought hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's time to let her rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've already done\Neverything that I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone on Scrap Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Straw Hat ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna did quite a number on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is from long before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to sail one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hope for this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another tidal wave's about to hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm ready, you ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather's still too rough out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? No,\Nno. We'll go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The miracle of a ship that's gone beyond\Nits limits to see you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know, I've been a\Nshipwright for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen a ship\Nas incredible as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's lived a splendid life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to the seas of adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:06:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.42,0:08:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary, I know the floor of the\Nsea is a dark and lonely place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but don't worry, we're\Nhere to see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you wish you was here, but it's\Nprobably best that Usopp isn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you can take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must all say our farewells someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every man knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must hold back our tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy knows what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for carrying us for\Nso long and for so far, Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real Carabelle!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:09.88,0:10:19.02,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Every day we'd play covered in mud until the sun set}We spent every day covered in mud until the sun set
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the going Mary has\Neverything she can possibly need!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:19.12,0:10:28.22,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{It's hard to abandon those innocent days we spent}It's hard to leave behind those innocent days
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to a new ship and a new Gourmet!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:29.01,0:10:38.52,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Even if I'm a dreamer, I'm still me}I'm a dreamer because that's who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.00,0:10:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all the damage\Nyou did to poor Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crew has to take care of its ship!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:38.67,0:10:47.14,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{So things don't all have to fit together like a jigsaw puzzle}I don't need to fit in like a piece of a jigsaw puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, we're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what's so loud down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cannon firing practice!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:47.76,0:10:57.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Just as someone's "Yes" could be a "No" to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's not going very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the expert aim the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blossom!
Dialogue: 6,0:10:57.04,0:11:07.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{you'll surely always be free}You should always be free
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit that on the first try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, whatcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you impressed yet?
Dialogue: 6,0:11:07.16,0:11:17.29,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Even if tomorrow a wind passes through and breaks the puzzle}If the puzzle is missing a piece\Nwhen the wind passes through tomorrow,
Dialogue: 6,0:11:17.29,0:11:26.18,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{N}no one would blame you for that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the Grand\NLine to find the all-blue.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:26.18,0:11:31.79,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We had a dream that day}We knew we weren't wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:31.79,0:11:36.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Our belief in ourselves}For the dreams we had before
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's best swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going so I can draw\Na map of the whole world.
Dialogue: 6,0:11:36.41,0:11:45.66,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{makes us able to cross the wildly surging ocean}That helps us cross a wildly surging ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a brave\Nwarrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 6,0:11:45.66,0:11:55.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We know the pain that you hold in your heart, so...}We know the pain that's in your heart,
Dialogue: 6,0:11:55.16,0:12:05.04,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{If you ever depart this ship and live in a different world}so even if you were to get off this ship\Nand find yourself on the other side,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entrance to the\NGrand Line is a mountain!
Dialogue: 6,0:12:05.04,0:12:14.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{In the end, we can all surely smile}you'll surely smile in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest\Nsea in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look back! We're\Ngoing straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's\Nnowhere left for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that matter, there's no\Nplace for me to return to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I've decided to stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess there's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:17.25,0:13:26.95,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We continue to dream even today}We still have our dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm a navigator, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're headed to the sky!
Dialogue: 6,0:13:26.95,0:13:37.16,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{Carrying the feelings you entrusted with us as well}And the memories given to us
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island!
Dialogue: 6,0:13:37.16,0:13:46.20,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{We once again cross these rough seas and fight the pain}Today, we continue fighting the pain as we cross these rough seas
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:46.20,0:13:54.41,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{So that our promise won't become a lie}So that our promises won't become lies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.16,0:13:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 6,0:13:54.41,0:14:05.37,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{And someday, to you who departed our ship and live in a different world,}And someday, to you who departed our ship to live on the other side,
Dialogue: 6,0:14:05.37,0:14:16.08,Lyrics,song,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}{we'll deliver the completed puzzle}we'll deliver a completed puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to carry everyone\Njust a little bit further.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish our adventures would never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry, I... No, Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone should apologize,\Nit's us, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no good at steering!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ran you into icebergs\Nand all kinds of stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took bad care of you\Nand ripped your sails!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji are idiots too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were breaking your\Nstuff all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp tried to fix you, but\Nhe wasn't any good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone sorry, it's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you always treated me with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the time we\Nspent together was short,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that I could spend it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.10,0:16:45.15,Credits,c,0,0,0,,Editing:\N Galaxy 9000\N\NTiming:\NPhosCity\N\NQuality Control:\Ndanpmss,\NGalaxy 9000,\NPepperjack,\NZenef\N\NSoundtracking:\N Halee\N\NGraphics:\N Datenshi\N\NKaraoke:\NKaitouYahiko\N\NTranslation:\NCrunchyroll,\NGaijin

